# The Fire Crystal's "cost {1} less" reduces generic mana only (CR 118.7c): Lightning Bolt ({R}) has none, so it still costs a red mana.
# In turn 3 Bot1 taps a Mountain and casts the Bolt: the Mountain's {R} is spent and the mana pool is empty afterwards (a Bolt reduced
# to nothing would leave the red in the pool).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
The Fire Crystal
Lightning Bolt
Mountain
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
